# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Root build context hygiene.
#
# The Docker build context is the repository root (see the installer compose
# files: `context: ../..`). Without this file every build shipped node_modules,
# the control plane (.codx), the docs and the design sources, which is the
# single biggest cost of building codx-junior.
#
# Keep this file in sync with what the Dockerfiles actually COPY:
#   client/ api/ scripts/ codx-junior/ set_env.sh entrypoint.sh supervisor.conf
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Control plane (.codx). Nothing that lives in git is stripped from a build:
# the TRACKED half (profiles, tasks, boards, views, teams, workspaces) stays in
# the context, so the `-dev` flavour (demo/up.sh --dev) builds against the real
# control plane of the checkout. Only the GENERATED data plane is dropped: it is
# runtime state and it is big (1.5 GB of chat turns, browser sessions and atlas
# indexes on a developer box). The release image never COPYs .codx at all — it
# is created at first boot inside the `codx-junior-settings` volume (see
# demo/docker-compose.yaml). Same list as .gitignore: DATA_PLANE_ENTRIES.
.codx/chat_turns/
.codx/browser_sessions/
.codx/browser_downloads/
.codx/computer_downloads/
.codx/computer_library/
.codx/harness/
.codx/orchestration/
.codx/board_manager/
.codx/autonomy/
.codx/atlas/
.codx/db/
.codx/logs/
.codx/media/
.codx/tmp/
.codx/cache/
.codx/secrets/
**/.codx-browser-downloads/
**/.codx/secrets/

# Node
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/npm-debug.log*

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/.venv_*/
**/venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/.coverage
api/build/

# Docs, design and long-form content. NOTE: no blanket `*.md` rule: the runtime
# loads Markdown prompts (api/codx/junior/knowledge/prepromts, profiles/*.md),
# so those files must stay in the context.
docs/
design/
wiki/
api/wiki/
api/docs/
api/slides/
api/tmpf3036q86/
**/*.pdf

# Version control and editors
.git/
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# Local environment and secrets
**/.env
**/.env.local
!**/.env.example

# Logs and runtime artifacts. NEVER `**/analytics/`: it also matches the SPA
# sources in client/src/components/analytics, which the client build imports
# (client/src/router/index.ts) and `npm run build-only` then fails with ENOENT.
# The runtime analytics data lives outside the build context anyway:
# CODX_JUNIOR_API_ANALYTICS_DATA_PATH=/home/codx-junior/analytics (set_env.sh).
**/*.log
**/codx-junior-static/
**/lighthouse_report.json

# Tests and test fixtures
api/tests/
**/tests/

# Installer assets that are never copied into a runtime image
codx-junior-installer/vllm/
codx-junior-installer/codx-junior-dind/
codx-junior-installer/codx-junior/workspaces/
codx-junior-installer/codx-junior/traefik/
codx-junior-installer/codx-junior/localai/
codx-junior-installer/codx-junior/litellm/
codx-junior-installer/*.md
